      <article class="node page page--full">
              <h1 class="display-4 no-top-page-header">
<span>Our members</span>
</h1>
        
            <div class="page__body"><p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span><span><span lang="EN-IN"><span>EFAMA is <a href="/about-efama-0">a pan-European organisation</a> </span></span><span><span lang="EN-IN"><span>representing the full diversity of the European investment management industry towards European policymakers, as well as international public bodies.&nbsp; Our membership consists of national associations (Ordinary and Extraordinary Members), which bring their country-specific expertise and viewpoints to our committees, &nbsp;as well as &nbsp;Corporate and Associate Members, which add multinational company and practitioner perspectives to our work.</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      <div class="page__field-view-paragraph">
